#
# Trip Context
#
TripContext isA Context
"TripContext" is name of it
"2016-01-04" is since of it
"2026-09-11" is updated of it
"https://contexts.bitplan.com/index.php/TripContext" is master of it
"(c) 2016-2026 Maria & Wolfgang Fahl" is copyright of it
"property" is storemode of it

#
# Trip Topic
#
Trip isA Topic
"Trip" is name of it
"Trips" is pluralName of it
"A trip from a start location to a destination consisting of ordered legs" is documentation of it
"A trip is the root of a journey: it has a start and a destination, a time span and an ordered list of [[Concept:Leg|legs]] between [[Concept:Loc|locations]]. Legs and locations are stored as subobjects on the trip page." is wikiDocumentation of it
"File:Tour-Icon.png" is icon of it
"/images/thumb/0/09/Tour-Icon.png/128px-Tour-Icon.png" is iconUrl of it
"property" is defaultstoremode of it
false is cargo of it
"TripContext" is context of it

# Properties of Trip
Trip_name addsTo it
Trip_title addsTo it
Trip_from addsTo it
Trip_to addsTo it
Trip_start addsTo it
Trip_end addsTo it
Trip_participants addsTo it
Trip_status addsTo it
Trip_source addsTo it
Trip_description addsTo it

# property name
Trip_name isA Property
"name" is name of it
"name" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
1 is index of it
true is primaryKey of it
true is mandatory of it
"short name of the trip used as page name e.g. BariLjubljana2026" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property title
Trip_title isA Property
"title" is name of it
"title" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
2 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
"human readable title of the trip" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property from
Trip_from isA Property
"from" is name of it
"from" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
3 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
true is mandatory of it
"id of the start location of the trip" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property to
Trip_to isA Property
"to" is name of it
"to" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
4 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
true is mandatory of it
"id of the destination of the trip" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property start
Trip_start isA Property
"start" is name of it
"start" is label of it
"Date" is type of it
5 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
"datepicker" is inputType of it
"first day of the trip" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property end
Trip_end isA Property
"end" is name of it
"end" is label of it
"Date" is type of it
6 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
"datepicker" is inputType of it
"last day of the trip" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property participants
Trip_participants isA Property
"participants" is name of it
"participants" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
7 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
"who travels" is documentation of it
true is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property status
Trip_status isA Property
"status" is name of it
"status" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
8 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
"planned,ongoing,done" is allowedValues of it
"radiobutton" is inputType of it
"planning state of the trip" is documentation of it
