# property source
Trip_source isA Property
"source" is name of it
"source" is label of it
"URL" is type of it
9 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
"url of the source the trip is derived from e.g. a YouTube playlist or a travel blog" is documentation of it
false is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

# property description
Trip_description isA Property
"description" is name of it
"description" is label of it
"Text" is type of it
10 is index of it
false is primaryKey of it
false is mandatory of it
