"description of the trip" is documentation of it
false is showInGrid of it
"Trip" is topic of it

#
# Leg Topic
#
Leg isA Topic
"Leg" is name of it
"Legs" is pluralName of it
"A segment of a trip between two locations with one mode of transport" is documentation of it
"A leg is one segment of a [[Concept:Trip|trip]] between two [[Concept:Loc|locations]] travelled with a single mode of transport on a given date. Legs are ordered by num within their trip page." is wikiDocumentation of it
"File:Flag-Icon.png" is icon of it
"/images/1/1c/Flag-Icon.png" is iconUrl of it
"subobject" is defaultstoremode of it
false is cargo of it
"TripContext" is context of it

