#
# Loc Topic
#
Loc isA Topic
"Loc" is name of it
"Locations" is pluralName of it
"A location of a trip such as a city, station, port or hotel" is documentation of it
"A location referenced by the legs of a [[Concept:Trip|trip]] by its id. The Wikidata item links the location to the map options of [https://velorail.bitplan.com velorail]; the coordinates feed the map of the trip." is wikiDocumentation of it
"File:Location_pin_icon.png" is icon of it
"/images/thumb/2/2a/Location_pin_icon.png/128px-Location_pin_icon.png" is iconUrl of it
"subobject" is defaultstoremode of it
false is cargo of it
"TripContext" is context of it

